<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>1440p, 5:1 ration reel, 2 speed</Major>
    <Description>Will cast reel to full or near full power then do a twitch  reel in, great for bass on Everglades .
If fish caught it will keep for money then repeat. if there is no fish it will detect the reel is at 0 distance and reset the script for a repeated recast. if you see the hotkey menu, dont worry, it is there to reset  the mouse postition so the script works properly with selling the fish. *MUST BE IN WINDOWED MODE*-(ALT+ENTER)

Update: More Reliable Full Cast
</Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
